!! duckdb client is builtin

Notebook-kit provides `DuckDBClient` for creating [[duckdb|https://duckdb.org]] databases (similar to sqlite).

Notebook-kit also provides builtin dataset names. Here 3 of them are used (`cars`, `olympians`, and `penguins`) to create some tables. In addition a `test` table is created using a static array of javascript objects.